  "description": "Dairy makes up a larger business share in Victoria and Tasmania than across the eight states combined. Each cell divides a sector\u2019s share within that state by its share across all eight states. Darker blue means greater concentration. Below 1\u00d7 is under-represented; above 1\u00d7 is over-represented. This compares business mix, not productivity or absolute counts. Labels highlight dairy in Victoria and Tasmania; choose a sector for its labels. Exact values are in tooltips and the table. Small territory counts can produce volatile ratios."
